      "statement": "submitMove validates a swap through ordered short-circuiting gates — session/auth, then rate limit (30 per 60s under scope match:submit-move), then match state (must be in_progress and caller a player), then round state (must be collecting), then clock expiry, then move application (bounds, same-tile, frozen tiles, duplicate) — returning on the first failing gate before any board mutation.",
